WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,990 --> 00:00:05,060
Auntie, there is some candy here

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:09,100
Fish wants candy

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,100
Tell aunt what your name is

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,230
Lin Shiyu

5
00:00:13,230 --> 00:00:15,420
small min fish

6
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:16,420
What a nice name

7
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:18,420
Sister-in-law, the meat is here

8
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:20,290
How much

9
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:23,350
In our relationship, what's the point of talking about money when it's real money?

10
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:27,500
My sister-in-law really thought it was good, so she helped me promote it.

11
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:33,800
Lao Wang said you knew how to do business. He was right.

12
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,800
Xiaohua, didn’t you say the pork was delicious at lunch?

13
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:37,800
I'm in the store now

14
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,800
This meat is not available every day

15
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,800
How much does it cost per pound? Can it be delivered to your home?
